{"body":"## Summary\n- curate all six GOA rows for PSEPK `phaA`/PhaC1, `phaC`/PhaC2, and `phaZ`, plus missing evidence-backed terms for zero-row `phaG`\n- add a reusable three-part mcl-PHA module with optional PhaG routing, class II PhaC polymerization, and intracellular PhaZ mobilization\n- integrate all materialized OpenScientist outputs, including the correct UPA00212 module+pathway+taxon report; exclude the unrelated ppu00500 trehalose report\n- preserve uncertainty around PhaG chemistry, candidate PP_0763 CoA activation, and PhaC1/PhaC2 division of labor\n\n## Modeling\nMolecular functions are confined to leaf annotons. PhaG is an optional routing role with no asserted module reaction substrates/products because direct transacylation versus thioesterase-plus-ligase remains unresolved. PhaC1 and PhaC2 are co-exemplars of one class II synthase role, not sequential steps or established primary/secondary isoenzymes.\n\n## Validation\n- `just validate PSEPK phaA`\n- `just validate PSEPK phaC`\n- `just validate PSEPK phaG`\n- `just validate PSEPK phaZ`\n- ModuleReview LinkML validation\n- semantic module validation\n- rendered four genes, module, and project page\n- `git diff --check`\n\nSemantic validation passes with advisory-only unavailable ontology lookup for NCBITaxon and InterPro labels.\n\n## Residual gaps\n- native PhaG chemistry and any PP_0763 requirement\n- KT2440-specific PhaC1/PhaC2 contributions, substrate preferences, and granule occupancy\n- detailed PhaZ product distribution and turnover kinetics\n","files":[{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaA/phaA-ai-review.html","additions":180,"deletions":233,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaA/phaA-ai-review.yaml","additions":68,"deletions":88,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaC/phaC-ai-review.html","additions":594,"deletions":19,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaC/phaC-ai-review.yaml","additions":48,"deletions":8,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaC/phaC-deep-research-openscientist.md","additions":297,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaC/phaC-deep-research-openscientist_artifacts/final_report.html","additions":531,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaC/phaC-deep-research-openscientist_artifacts/final_report.pdf","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaG/phaG-ai-review.html","additions":242,"deletions":111,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaG/phaG-ai-review.yaml","additions":36,"deletions":23,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaG/phaG-notes.md","additions":18,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaZ/phaZ-ai-review.html","additions":485,"deletions":210,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaZ/phaZ-ai-review.yaml","additions":36,"deletions":43,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaZ/phaZ-deep-research-openscientist.md","additions":285,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaZ/phaZ-deep-research-openscientist_artifacts/final_report.html","additions":502,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"genes/PSEPK/phaZ/phaZ-deep-research-openscientist_artifacts/final_report.pdf","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"modules/bacterial_mcl_pha_synthesis_and_mobilization.yaml","additions":272,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"pages/modules/bacterial_mcl_pha_synthesis_and_mobilization.html","additions":910,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"pages/projects/P_PUTIDA/batches/mcl_pha_synthesis_and_mobilization.html","additions":503,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/P_PUTIDA/batches/mcl_pha_synthesis_and_mobilization.md","additions":88,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"projects/P_PUTIDA/batches/mcl_pha_synthesis_and_mobilization.tsv","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"publications/PMID_20937103.md","additions":208,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"mergedAt":"2026-08-28T02:49:31Z","number":2585,"state":"MERGED","title":"Curate bacterial mcl-PHA synthesis and mobilization","url":"https://github.com/ai4curation/ai-gene-review/pull/2585"}
